      "sourceTextSha256": "1a756169389c75ad25e9b1c29575b87c99825b8981121417f5e84d1b8f67cbe2",
      "text": "Ten days from the colonial streets of León and Granada to Ometepe Island and the Pacific coast. The programme includes Masaya's crater, a boat trip among the islets of Lake Nicaragua, ziplining on Mombacho and Ojo de Agua. The journey ends with 3 free days in San Juan del Sur. The tour operates for groups of at least 2 people.",
